Dialogue: 0,0:04:45.51,0:04:50.01,OPJP,,0,0,0,,{\fad(526,513)\blur5}愛してるって何だろうね
Dialogue: 0,0:04:51.01,0:04:54.77,OPJP,,0,0,0,,{\fad(479,476)\blur5}辞書を引いてもピンと来なくて
Dialogue: 0,0:04:54.77,0:04:59.52,OPJP,,0,0,0,,{\fad(500,430)\blur5\fad(200,200)}そうね、愛って何だろうね
Dialogue: 0,0:04:59.73,0:05:05.95,OPJP,,0,0,0,,{\blur5\fad(200,520)}語り尽くせぬこの痛みが愛なんかも
Dialogue: 0,0:05:06.95,0:05:11.66,OPJP,,0,0,0,,{\blur5\fad(524,500)}始まりの対に終わりを創る
Dialogue: 0,0:05:12.70,0:05:16.12,OPJP,,0,0,0,,{\blur5\fad(200,200)}神様はとても残酷だよね
Dialogue: 0,0:05:17.71,0:05:21.38,OPJP,,0,0,0,,{\blur5\fad(200,200)}人間はきっと勇敢なんだ
Dialogue: 0,0:05:17.71,0:05:21.38,OPJP,,0,0,0,,{\blur5\fad(200,200)\fs35\pos(780,2)}ぼくら
Dialogue: 0,0:05:22.88,0:05:26.30,OPJP,,0,0,0,,{\blur5\fad(200,516)}終わりを知れどまだ前へ進むから
Dialogue: 0,0:05:26.84,0:05:31.47,OPJP,,0,0,0,,{\blur5\fad(200,500)}何を引き換えにしようとも
Dialogue: 0,0:05:32.06,0:05:36.48,OPJP,,0,0,0,,{\blur5\fad(200,200)}何度だって汚すよこの手なら
Dialogue: 0,0:05:37.06,0:05:41.19,OPJP,,0,0,0,,{\blur5\fad(200,200)}後悔に似た罪の意識
Dialogue: 0,0:05:42.15,0:05:46.24,OPJP,,0,0,0,,{\blur5\fad(200,200)}隠して歩む道は何処へと続くの
Dialogue: 0,0:05:49.36,0:05:51.62,OPJP,,0,0,0,,{\blur5\fad(200,200)}いつか君が死んじゃうって
Dialogue: 0,0:05:51.62,0:05:54.87,OPJP,,0,0,0,,{\blur5\fad(200,200)}想像するだけで痛いんだ
Dialogue: 0,0:05:54.87,0:05:57.54,OPJP,,0,0,0,,{\blur5\fad(526,0)}心臓を握りつぶすのは誰?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:54.87,0:05:57.54,OPJP,,0,0,0,,{\blur5\fad(526,0)\fs35\pos(770,2)}こころ
Dialogue: 0,0:05:57.54,0:05:59.71,OPJP,,0,0,0,,{\blur5\fad(0,200)}キミが愛なんだろうね
Dialogue: 0,0:05:59.71,0:06:02.38,OPJP,,0,0,0,,{\blur5\fad(200,200)}いつか二人を引き離す終わりが
Dialogue: 0,0:06:02.38,0:06:04.42,OPJP,,0,0,0,,{\blur5\fad(200,200)}迎えに来ようとも
Dialogue: 0,0:06:04.42,0:06:09.89,OPJP,,0,0,0,,{\blur5\fad(200,500)}誰も追いつけやしないスピードで
Dialogue: 0,0:06:09.89,0:06:14.01,OPJP,,0,0,0,,{\blur5\fad(200,500)}どこまでも逃げてみせるよ
Comment: 0,0:04:45.01,0:04:45.01,Default,,0,0,0,,————OPCN————
Dialogue: 0,0:04:45.51,0:04:50.01,OPCN,,0,0,0,,{\fsp4\fad(526,513)\blur5\fad(200,200)}永恆的愛到底是什麼呢
Dialogue: 0,0:04:51.01,0:04:54.77,OPCN,,0,0,0,,{\fad(479,476)\blur5\fad(200,200)\fsp4}翻遍字典都毫無頭緒
Dialogue: 0,0:04:54.77,0:04:59.52,OPCN,,0,0,0,,{\fad(500,430)\blur5\fad(200,200)\fad(200,200)\fsp4}是啊、愛到底是什麼呢
Dialogue: 0,0:04:59.73,0:05:05.95,OPCN,,0,0,0,,{\blur5\fad(200,520)\fad(200,200)\fsp4}或許這份道不清說不明的痛楚便是愛吧
Dialogue: 0,0:05:06.95,0:05:11.66,OPCN,,0,0,0,,{\blur5\fad(524,500)\fad(200,200)\fsp4}有開始便會創造結束
Dialogue: 0,0:05:12.70,0:05:16.12,OPCN,,0,0,0,,{\blur5\fad(200,200)\fad(200,200)\fsp4}神明真是殘忍啊
Dialogue: 0,0:05:17.71,0:05:21.38,OPCN,,0,0,0,,{\blur5\fad(200,200)\fad(200,200)\fsp4}作為人類的我們定是生性勇敢
Dialogue: 0,0:05:22.88,0:05:26.30,OPCN,,0,0,10,,{\blur5\fad(200,516)\fad(200,200)\fsp4}即便知道會走向結束也不斷邁步前行
Dialogue: 0,0:05:26.84,0:05:31.47,OPCN,,0,0,0,,{\blur5\fad(200,500)\fad(200,200)\fsp4}無論付出什麼
Dialogue: 0,0:05:32.06,0:05:36.48,OPCN,,0,0,0,,{\blur5\fad(200,200)\fad(200,200)\fsp4}這雙骯髒的雙手早已
Dialogue: 0,0:05:37.06,0:05:41.19,OPCN,,0,0,0,,{\blur5\fad(200,200)\fad(200,200)\fsp4}充斥著無異於遺憾的罪惡感
Dialogue: 0,0:05:42.15,0:05:46.24,OPCN,,0,0,0,,{\blur5\fad(200,200)\fad(200,200)\fsp4}隱藏的道路將會延續到何處
Dialogue: 0,0:05:49.36,0:05:51.62,OPCN,,0,0,0,,{\blur5\fad(200,200)\fad(200,200)\fsp4}一想起你總有一天會死去
Dialogue: 0,0:05:51.62,0:05:54.87,OPCN,,0,0,0,,{\blur5\fad(200,200)\fad(200,200)\fsp4}我就萬分痛苦
Dialogue: 0,0:05:54.87,0:05:57.54,OPCN,,0,0,0,,{\blur5\fad(526,0)\fad(200,200)\fsp4}讓我心碎的人究竟是誰
Dialogue: 0,0:05:57.54,0:05:59.71,OPCN,,0,0,0,,{\blur5\fad(0,200)\fad(200,200)\fsp4}你便是所謂的愛吧
Dialogue: 0,0:05:59.71,0:06:02.38,OPCN,,0,0,0,,{\blur5\fad(200,200)\fad(200,200)\fsp4}儘管會將二人分離的結局
Dialogue: 0,0:06:02.38,0:06:04.42,OPCN,,0,0,0,,{\blur5\fad(200,200)\fad(200,200)\fsp4}始終都會來臨
Dialogue: 0,0:06:04.42,0:06:09.89,OPCN,,0,0,0,,{\blur5\fad(200,500)\fad(200,200)\fsp4}我也會以迅雷不及掩耳之勢
Dialogue: 0,0:06:09.89,0:06:14.01,OPCN,,0,0,5,,{\blur5\fad(200,500)\fad(200,200)\fsp4}逃脫給你看
Comment: 0,0:22:05.96,0:22:05.96,Default,,0,0,0,,————EDJP————
Dialogue: 0,0:22:06.57,0:22:11.27,EDEN,,0,0,0,,{\fad(200,200)}I decided to be stronger than anyone around
Dialogue: 0,0:22:11.27,0:22:14.14,EDEN,,0,0,0,,{\fad(200,200)}Goodbye old self goodbye
Dialogue: 0,0:22:23.09,0:22:26.44,EDEN,,0,0,0,,{\fad(200,200)}Now it’s time for me to take a breath
Dialogue: 0,0:22:27.78,0:22:31.24,EDEN,,0,0,0,,{\fad(200,200)}You know I don’t want to lose anything
Dialogue: 0,0:22:32.22,0:22:35.50,EDEN,,0,0,0,,{\fad(200,200)}Don’t wanna see the end I need this more
Dialogue: 0,0:22:36.75,0:22:40.32,EDEN,,0,0,0,,{\fad(200,200)}I want to feel the warmth I can’t let go
Dialogue: 0,0:22:40.32,0:22:44.51,EDEN,,0,0,0,,{\fad(200,200)}Not gonna give it up because I know my strength
Dialogue: 0,0:22:44.91,0:22:49.49,EDEN,,0,0,0,,{\fad(200,200)}I’m barely breathing but I’m keepin’ up to live my life
Dialogue: 0,0:22:51.24,0:22:55.72,EDEN,,0,0,1,,{\fad(200,200)}I decided to be stronger than anyone around
Dialogue: 0,0:22:56.17,0:22:59.63,EDEN,,0,0,1,,{\fad(200,200)}I hide my trembling hand and just keep pushin’ on
Dialogue: 0,0:23:00.17,0:23:04.90,EDEN,,0,0,1,,{\fad(200,200)}Cause the things I need to guard gives me the power to conquer carry on
Dialogue: 0,0:23:04.90,0:23:06.80,EDEN,,0,0,0,,{\fad(200,200)}Goodbye old self
Dialogue: 0,0:23:06.80,0:23:11.51,EDEN,,0,0,0,,{\fad(200,200)}Never going back to the me I fought to leave behind
Dialogue: 0,0:23:11.51,0:23:14.65,EDEN,,0,0,0,,{\fad(200,200)}Hello new me, this time
Comment: 0,0:22:05.96,0:22:05.96,Default,,0,0,0,,————EDCN————
Dialogue: 0,0:22:06.57,0:22:11.27,EDCN,,0,0,0,,{\fad(200,200)\b1\fsp4}我已決定變得比周遭都堅強
Dialogue: 0,0:22:11.27,0:22:14.14,EDCN,,0,0,0,,{\fad(200,200)\b1\fsp4}再見  曾經的我  再也不見
Dialogue: 0,0:22:23.09,0:22:26.44,EDCN,,0,0,0,,{\fad(200,200)\b1\fsp4}是時候讓我深吸一口氣
Dialogue: 0,0:22:27.78,0:22:31.24,EDCN,,0,0,0,,{\fad(200,200)\b1\fsp4}我什麼都不想失去
Dialogue: 0,0:22:32.22,0:22:35.50,EDCN,,0,0,0,,{\fad(200,200)\b1\fsp4}只有更加努力才能避免最壞的結局
Dialogue: 0,0:22:36.75,0:22:40.32,EDCN,,0,0,0,,{\fad(200,200)\b1\fsp4}想感受無法釋懷的溫存
Dialogue: 0,0:22:40.32,0:22:44.51,EDCN,,0,0,0,,{\fad(200,200)\b1\fsp4}我深知我的無力  因而我永不言棄
Dialogue: 0,0:22:44.91,0:22:49.49,EDCN,,0,0,0,,{\fad(200,200)\b1\fsp4}就算快要窒息  我也要守護住現在的生活
Dialogue: 0,0:22:51.24,0:22:55.72,EDCN,,0,0,0,,{\fad(200,200)\b1\fsp4}我已決定變得比周遭都堅強
Dialogue: 0,0:22:56.17,0:22:59.63,EDCN,,0,0,0,,{\fad(200,200)\b1\fsp4}我必須藏起顫抖的手  繼續前行
Dialogue: 0,0:23:00.17,0:23:04.90,EDCN,,0,0,0,,{\fad(200,200)\b1\fsp4}因為我要守護的東西給了我戰勝怯弱的力量
Dialogue: 0,0:23:04.90,0:23:06.80,EDCN,,0,0,0,,{\fad(200,200)\b1\fsp4}再見  曾經的我
Dialogue: 0,0:23:06.80,0:23:11.51,EDCN,,0,0,0,,{\fad(200,200)\b1\fsp4}再也不會變回那個我努力拋之於後的自己
Dialogue: 0,0:23:11.51,0:23:14.65,EDCN,,0,0,0,,{\fad(200,200)\b1\fsp4}你好  新生的我  此時此刻
